                <person xml:id="MOI01" sex="2">
                    <persName>
                        <roleName/>
                        <forename>Elizabeth</forename>
                        <surname>Rawdon</surname>
                        <addName>née Hastings, suo jure Baroness Botreaux, suo jure Baroness Hungerford, suo jure Baroness Moleyns, suo jure Baroness Hastings, and countess of Moira</addName>
                    </persName>
                    <birth when="1731">
                        <placeName/>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1808"/>
                    <occupation/>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Probably the mother of Lord Moira (Hastings, 
    Francis Rawdon, first marquess of Hastings and second earl of Moira 
    (1754–1826), army officer and politician- see <title>DNB</title>. )  Lady Elizabeth Hastings 
    (1731–1808), the daughter of Theophilus Hastings, ninth earl of Huntingdon. 
    Lord Moira succeeded to the title in 1793.  He did not marry until 1804. 
    Godwin meets Lady Moira on his trip to ireland in 1800.</p>
                        <p> 'Countess of Moira dies' recorded in 1808.</p>
                    </note>
